{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act13d5_level_act13d5_01_beg",
  "groupId": "act13d5",
  "stageId": "act13d5_01",
  "title": "艾伦精选",
  "storyCode": "MN-1",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act13d5/level_act13d5_01_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "490307e26e33daed202197fb3f2ca4195fdef8a6667a6b5fd982f6e373371c22",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "卡西米尔 1上"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "text": "玛莉娅！怎么样了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "稍等——马上就好！就差一个螺丝！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "text": "拧紧点！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "好的！啊，等等！我好像知道底部电池槽接触不良的原因了——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "text": "快！这个点唱机老沉了，我要抬不动了——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光头马丁",
      "text": "你的芝士片，老弗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "text": "......喂，这次不会爆炸了吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光头马丁",
      "text": "修个点唱机也能爆炸是不是夸张了点？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "text": "不好说，和源石有关系的东西，老科瓦尔都能搞砸。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "text": "谁在说我坏话！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "科瓦尔师傅！小、小心点！别乱晃！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "text": "喔哦哦——抱歉，玛莉娅。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "text": "老弗！等我空出手来你就完了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "text": "好，我等着——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光头马丁",
      "text": "我这酒吧全靠你俩炒热气氛了，但是别打起来，砸了杯子要赔的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "text": "他都叨叨几十年了，你哪次见他动手赢得过我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光头马丁",
      "text": "上次。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "text": "呃......上次我喝醉了，还犯关节炎......那不算数。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "text": "咕嘟咕嘟——哈，当年他陪着我赶赴边疆的时候可不敢这么和我说话......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "text": "老弗！你是不是又在说什么大话！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "text": "当年你是不是我的扈从！你就说是不是！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "text": "这都几几年了，扈从都已经穿上西装变成你们的主子了——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "玛莉娅！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "噫！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "text": "啊——！痛！丫头，你别突然放手啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "抱、抱歉......先让我躲一下.....",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光头马丁",
      "text": "佐菲娅，轻点，这个月已经换了几次大门了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光头马丁",
      "text": "唉，这就是我不愿意花钱换自动门的原因啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "text": "发生什么了，干嘛这么气势汹汹的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "在那儿是吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "玛、莉、娅！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "噫——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "text": "喂，丫头，她走过来了，你好像没藏住。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "呜......这个点唱机为什么这么小啦......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "她现在什么表情？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "text": "不妙哦，自上次她把那个喝醉的小鬼骑士扔出去之后我还没看过她那么生气。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "text": "——啊，她微笑着走过来了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "那更不妙了啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "科瓦尔？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "text": "咳——老弗！来喝酒！你刚才是不是说我坏话了！我今天必把你喝趴下！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "text": "啧，临阵脱逃的胆小鬼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光头马丁",
      "text": "那你怎么不去帮玛莉娅说说话？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "text": "我、我又不知道出什么事儿了！不要乱说话比较好！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "玛、莉、娅，你躲什么呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "......呃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "你是不是......有什么事瞒着我呀？虽然我已经全部知道了喔？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "哈、哈哈......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "......唉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "你知道骑士竞技意味着什么吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光头马丁",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "text": "嚯......难怪佐菲娅那么生气。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "为什么不和我商量？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "因为、因为佐菲娅姐姐一定会生气的呀......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "我当然会生气了！因为你根本不明白你面对的是什么！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "噫......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "但我、我还是稍微了解过一点的啦......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "......通过你姐姐？通过卡西米尔的耀骑士，特锦赛最年轻的奇迹之一？是哦，你很了解呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "但——你——又——不——是——玛——嘉——烈——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "别、别揪我耳朵——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "但是、但是我们家现在的情况真的越来越糟糕了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "说真的，明年我说不定就没有床睡觉了！家具都要卖光了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "没有长骑的骑士家族不会被认可，协会已经来催过很多次了......我、我也没办法......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "......就算这样，你也可以住在我们家啊。浴池也很大，还有两座花园......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "不管怎么说，你都不该这么草率地成为竞技骑士......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "......祖父去世之后，叔叔依旧不愿意与骑士协会有什么牵连......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "姐姐被赶出卡西米尔也有一段时间了，如果我还不能扛起一些责任的话......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "......唉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "就算这样，你也应该和我们商量一下才对......你太盲目了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "哎......所以这点我真心道歉啦......我是觉得佐菲娅姐姐你肯定会阻止我才......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "我当然会。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "......那现在呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "......“耀骑士再度出现？临光家族新骑士首秀，是否能夺回属于贵族的荣耀？”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "今天的竞技新闻报头条。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "啊哈哈......姐姐的名气真大啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "你还笑！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "虽然那些什么都做得出来的媒体肯定会用奇怪的标题和谣言来造势，但现在退出还来得及，真的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "但如果不这么的话临光家就会因为破产被剥夺骑士贵族的资格。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "我知道自己在做什么，佐菲娅姐姐......我......不得不做。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "你啊......马丁叔，你们对骑士竞技是什么样的再清楚不过了，你也劝劝——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光头马丁",
      "text": "是啊，嗯，不如就让她试试吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "——哈！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "马丁叔......！感谢！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "不不不，现在的玛莉娅连我一只手都打不过喔，你确定？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "这么过分！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "text": "话也不能这么说，你毕竟是特锦赛十六强骑士。能正面赢你一只手就已经过了合格线了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "text": "就是，老弗现在都赢不了你一只手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "text": "你再说一遍！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "text": "哈，这里的常客都是些退役的老家伙，实力也许不比从前了，但是论眼光......都是些老滑头了，欸，反正我觉得行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "text": "怎么说话的！老滑头又不是什么褒义词！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "text": "你懂我意思不就好了！你们这些骑士大爷讲话文绉绉的不累吗！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光头马丁",
      "text": "咳咳——老弗说得对。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光头马丁",
      "text": "我相信玛莉娅的天赋，她的源石技艺和剑术资质并不差，从小陪她练剑的你应该很清楚吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "......但是这几年她都沉迷于机工技术，我还以为她也许想当个工匠......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "工匠只是兴趣啦，虽然我也不想放弃这份兴趣......但是必须要做的事情更重要吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "疼！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "......我还没原谅你的自作主张，这次不是和你闹着玩的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光头马丁",
      "text": "......这我倒是赞同佐菲娅。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光头马丁",
      "text": "虽然我很赞许你那份为了家族豁出去还能保持乐观的心态，但骑士竞技并没有观众和游客们想的那么风光。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光头马丁",
      "text": "应该说，不止有风光。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "老马丁抬了抬他的手——他的大半只胳膊都被替换成了金属机械，关节处发出精巧的声响。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光头马丁",
      "text": "这只是一着不慎的结果。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "text": "是啊......我记得。对手是个耍双剑的维多利亚人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "text": "但最后还是你赢了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光头马丁",
      "text": "对，还是我赢了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光头马丁",
      "text": "这就是所谓的荣耀，我现在擦个杯子都费事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "text": "骑士竞技，哼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光头马丁",
      "text": "竞技场上不会有任何真正的怜悯和钦佩，只有洒下的血是货真价实的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光头马丁",
      "text": "观众的欢呼仅仅来自于刺激得到了满足，赞助商的礼遇也只是单纯的利益目的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光头马丁",
      "text": "想清楚，看清苦难再发起冲锋，才是真正的骑士必须具备的素养。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "我......我明白的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "......玛莉娅。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "......嗯。我是认真的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "叔叔他一直说着，哪怕被剥夺贵族身份，临光家的族徽就此消亡，也不代表“临光”不复存在......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "但我还是想保护那些东西，保护姐姐和爷爷......一直捍卫的东西。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "姐姐不在了，作为临光家最年轻的一代，我不能坐视临光家没落而无动于衷。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "否则我会恨死自己的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "text": "即使认识到一切残酷也决意要踏上征途，这才是骑士，无论时代如何。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "text": "我相信你能做到，这一杯敬你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "text": "哈，我也是，敬玛莉娅！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光头马丁",
      "text": "（无言举杯）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "......唉，我还指望你们能劝劝她，别跟着一道起哄啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "欸......佐菲娅，佐菲娅姐姐，佐菲娅姑母，求求你啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "不要用辈分称呼我！我才比你大五岁！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "......我好歹是临光家的陪侍，我当然理解你的想法，但我还是觉得——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "我会好好练剑的，一定会听话的，相信我！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "对了！不如就让佐菲娅来做我的教练——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "嚯......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "（糟——）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "说起来，上次我们好好练剑，已经是什么时候的事了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "......姐姐离开卡西米尔之前？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "那么上次教你的剑技是哪一式？出自哪国？如何应用？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "呃......哈哈哈......是......是哪一式来着？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "嗯，很好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "明早在花园训练场汇合，你不会迟到的，对吧？骑士玛莉娅小姐？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "嗯？嗯......嗯，一定，一定。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
